0.420 0.390 1.000 rg 0 782 612 10 re f 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg 64 46 484 1.5 re f 0.55 0.55 0.65 rg /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 30 Tm (KWL-NEXUS Integration Guide  -  Page 1 of 3) Tj BT 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 666.0 Tm (KWL-NEXUS) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F2 30 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 625.0 Tm (App Integration Guide) Tj 0.380 0.380 0.450 rg /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 600.0 Tm (For new app developers) Tj 0.380 0.380 0.450 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 580.0 Tm (Connect reports, tutorials, catalog and plans. Version 1.0.) Tj 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 546.0 Tm (1. Connect your app in 4 steps) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 506.0 Tm (Step 1 - Ask the Nexus admin for two things: \(a\) an API key) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 487.0 Tm (\(starts with kn_live_\) and \(b\) your appId \(Mongo ObjectId\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 463.0 Tm (Step 2 - Send the key on every request in the x-api-key header.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 439.0 Tm (Step 3 - Implement Reports \(section 3\) so users can send feedback.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 415.0 Tm (Step 4 - Implement Help/Tutorial \(section 4\) using cached content.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 391.0 Tm (Base URL is your Nexus domain, e.g. https://kwl-nexus.onrender.com) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 372.0 Tm (Keep the API key secret: ship it as a build secret, never in chat.) Tj 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 349.0 Tm (2. Authentication and limits) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 309.0 Tm (Header: x-api-key: kn_live_...  \(Authorization: Bearer also works\)) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 285.0 Tm (Rate limit: 1000 requests per hour per key \(shared by all installs\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 261.0 Tm (401 = missing/invalid/revoked key. 429 = slow down and retry later.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 237.0 Tm (404 on /apps/<id>/... usually means a wrong appId or unpublished app.) Tj 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 214.0 Tm (3. Reports API - POST /api/feedback) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 174.0 Tm (Send user reports \(errors, suggestions, feature requests, ratings\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 150.0 Tm (Required: appId, type, title \(3-160 chars\), description \(5-5000\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 131.0 Tm (type is one of: bug_report | suggestion | feature_request | rating) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 112.0 Tm (Optional: link \(problem URL, max 2000\), contactEmail, rating 1-5,) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 93.0 Tm (screenshot \(base64/text, max about 1.5MB\).) Tj 0.950 0.950 0.980 rg 56 70.0 500 15.0 re f 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 70.5 Tm (Example: {"appId":"<ObjectId>","type":"bug_report",) Tj ET
endstream
