pi/apps/new-releases  -  List latest new releases.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 352.5 Tm (GET  /api/public/apps  -  Public app directory \(no auth\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 335.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps/[id]/tutorial  -  Get tutorial for an app.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 318.5 Tm (GET  /api/payment/methods  -  List active payment methods \(filtered HEALTHY\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 301.5 Tm (POST  /api/payment/request  -  Create a pending payment request.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 284.5 Tm (GET  /api/payment/status/[id]  -  Read the authenticated payment status.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 267.5 Tm (GET  /api/payment/history  -  List authenticated payment history.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 250.5 Tm (GET  /api/user/profile  -  Read the authenticated user profile.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 233.5 Tm (GET  /api/user/subscriptions  -  List the authenticated user's subscriptions.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 216.5 Tm (POST  /api/feedback  -  Submit a user report \(bug/suggestion/feature/rating\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 199.5 Tm (GET  /api/feedback  -  List the authenticated user's feedback.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 182.5 Tm (GET  /api/system-config  -  Get public branding & system config.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 165.5 Tm (GET  /api/update-guidelines  -  Get latest update guidelines.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 148.5 Tm (GET  /api/health  -  Health check - keep-alive \(no auth\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 131.5 Tm (GET  /api/ping  -  Ping - keep-alive alias \(no auth\).) Tj 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 109.0 Tm (6. Support) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 69.0 Tm (Lost key? The admin revokes it and generates a new one in seconds:) Tj ET
